// chat.history payloads for PRD 05 (chat export), generated by reading the gateway source (QA, sprint 2026.9).
//
// Source: OpenClaw 2026.9.4 compiled dist (paths below are relative to package/dist). The
// older variant is the globally installed 2026.6.5 (dist/*.js).
//
// What this module gives the export tests (chatExport.test.ts, chatHistoryReader.test.ts,
// saveFile.test.ts) and the historyMessages regression tests:
//   - EXPORT_HISTORY_RESPONSE: one realistic tail page of a multi-turn "Pricing research" chat,
//     exactly as the 9.4 display projection returns it (oldest first): text, thinking,
//     toolCall + separate toolResult rows, an error result, an omitted image, a long reply
//     with nested ``` fences, a sessions_spawn call, a nested-tool-activity custom row, a
//     compaction marker, an oversized-placeholder toolResult (which LOSES its toolCallId), a
//     display-cap-truncated message, and a channel user row with senderLabel.
//   - PAGING_*: a three-page offset walk including the gateway's "replay oldest record" overlap.
//   - Older-gateway variants, spelling variants, error frames, chat.message.get and a
//     session.message event.
//
// Everything is plain data; nothing here imports app code that PR 2 adds.

// ── Gateway limits ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

